meta {
  name: Upload Image
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/uploads/image
  body: multipartForm
  auth: none
}

body:multipart-form {
  image: @file(/absolute/path/to/photo.jpg)
}

docs {
  # Upload Image

  Field name: `image` (single file).

  In Bruno, use the file picker for the `image` field — replace the placeholder path.

  **Example response**

  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "…",
    "data": {
      "url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/…/image/upload/…",
      "publicId": "bari-vara/…"
    }
  }
  ```

  Paste `url` / `publicId` into Create Flat `images`.
}
